  "project_description": "Provides the ability to display a customisable emergency notification on all pages, except pages excluded in configuration. Once dismissed, the emergency notification remains accessible through a button fixed to the bottom of the page. Configured at Configuration > System > Emergency Notification settings: set a title and rich-text notice, optional custom overlay/background/foreground colors, a path exclusion list, and an enable toggle. Requires no modules outside Drupal core.",
